section Source_FourCoordinateRealization

@[expose] public section

/-!
# Exact four-dimensional realization

This source preserves the recovered constructive proof, including all zero
patterns and singular boundary cases. The chapter names record its source
modules. The last theorem constructs an actual compact convex body from
any nonnegative hollow symmetric matrix with at most one positive eigenvalue.
